  <description>Coaxial helicopter with two counter-rotating fixed pitch rotors and a three servo swash plate on the lower rotor for cyclic control. Rotor aerodynamics, blade flapping, inflow and rotor wake interaction are simulated by the PX4 CoaxialRotorModel plugin.</description>
</model>
